title: Proletarian Defence
subtitle: Workers ask how to defend themselves against the völkisch bands.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: rf_party
view-if: rf_hundreds_timer <= 0 and year = 1923
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; rf_hundreds_timer = 3

= Proletarian Defence

Völkisch bands break up workers' meetings, and the police do little. In the factories, workers are forming defence units, Proletarian Hundreds, often with Social Democrats.

- @build
- @party

@build
title: Build the Hundreds with SPD and non-party workers.
subtitle: More readiness; better relations with SPD workers. Draws the police.
on-arrival: {!
Q.readiness += 4;
Q.spd_relation += 2;
Q.repression += 2;
window.RF.normalize(Q);
!}

Hundreds drill in the factory yards after the shift.

@party
title: Keep them under the party's control.
subtitle: More readiness; pleases the <span class="f-left">Left</span>. Draws the police.
on-arrival: {!
Q.readiness += 5;
window.RF.lean(Q, {left: 2});
Q.repression += 3;
window.RF.normalize(Q);
!}

Only reliable comrades are admitted.
